# Ignore everything by default.
# NOTE: Comment out this line temporarily when opening the project in an IDE
# (IntelliJ IDEA, VS Code) so it can index the worktree directories.
# Restore it afterwards to keep worktrees out of the wrapper repo's Git view.
/*

# Except the essential setup files and tooling directories
!README.md
!AGENTS.md
!agents/
!docs/
!skills/
!scripts/

# Allow git to descend into .local/, but ignore its contents (except the example template)
!.local/
.local/*
